## "er1600"
## an rz1600 emulator.

## <https://www.github.com/quxrzd/er1600>



## ABOUT
"er1600" is a rezoid(tm) rz1600 cycle-accurate emulator
implemented as a C++ library.



## BUILD
er1600 requires a C++11 compiler and make.
since this is developed on an Artix machine, I cannot
guarantee that this can run on a Windows machine.

note that the command is run with the "-f mkf" flag.


to build and get an executable, run make with the -f flag:
$ make -f mkf

to build, get an executable, and run that executable, run
make with the "run" target:
$ make -f mkf run

to clean out the executable, run make 
$ make -f mkf cls



